{"id":"gobierno","lemma":"gobierno","pos":"noun","rank":619,"glosses":["government"],"ipa":"/ɡoˈbjeɾno/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"gobiernos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-gobierno.wav","formAudio":{"gobiernos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-gobiernos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"El gobierno fue derrocado.","en":"The government was overthrown.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642043","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to overthrow","l":"derrocar"}]},{"text":"Ellos crearon un gobierno.","en":"They created a government.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to create","l":"crear"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"El nuevo gobierno tiene problemas financieros.","en":"The new government has financial troubles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926273","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"new"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"problem","l":"problema"},{"g":"financial","l":"financiero"}]},{"text":"Él siempre habla con desprecio del gobierno.","en":"He always speaks of the government with contempt.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/929072","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"speech"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"scorn, contempt"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"El gobierno nos ha abandonado.","en":"The government has abandoned us.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"us"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"abandoned"}]}]}